      "created_at": "2026-08-27T15:14:42Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-08-27T15:14:43Z",
      "body": "This is a false positive. MD5 is used here as a checksum, not as a security control — that's exactly what it's still appropriate for. There's no password, token, or integrity check involved.\r\n\r\nClosing this one, but thanks for the effort.   ",
